BEGIN;

-- v4 Bible expansion, part 3: 66 further people plus the character groups that
-- give the relationship graph a middle zoom tier. Life years stay as broad
-- ranges (or NULL where the text supplies no chronology at all) rather than
-- being sharpened into dates the sources do not support.

